{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25215","headline":"姑熟杂咏 慈姥竹 · 李赤","name":"姑熟杂咏 慈姥竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野竹攒石生，含烟映江岛。\n翠色落波深，虚声带寒早。\n龙吟曾未听，凤曲吹应好。\n不学蒲柳凋，贞心常自保。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李赤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗品彚（附唐诗拾遗）》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩品彚_(四庫全書本)）"}